WEBVTT

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.330
Before I kill you, I'll ask you a question.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:46.830
You're with the Insect Hunters, 
so why protect the princess?

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.670
I have nothing to say...

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:54.140
to an insect!

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:01.440
Then die!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.690
I have seen through your every illusion.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.260
I feel so much better in this form, 
don't you, Kamanosuke?

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.220
You're looking pretty sickly now.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:41.930
I like it. They're serious now.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:42.910
I won't lose!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:48.190
Now, then... Time for round two!

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:50.580
Sounds good to me.

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.010
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.380
Do my bidding!

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.900
We'll defeat you here!

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.160
<b>The Insect Magistrate's 
Cursed Past</b>

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:23.800
Sanada Yukimura!

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.280
This rat is a little scrawny.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.560
Do your best, little rat.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.920
The last rat,

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:38.570
the samurai with the quick draw, 
was at least enough to entertain me.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.240
What do you mean?!

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.990
You don't understand?

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.560
Y-You can't mean...

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.370
Oooka-dono!

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:54.380
Can you hear me, Oooka-dono?!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.250
That's impossible!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.540
Oooka-dono is a true samurai.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.800
He could never lose to an 
evil creature like you!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.220
How stupid.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:06.640
What?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.430
At every turn, you samurai speak of justice,

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.640
but what is the reality?

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.670
You can protect no one.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.140
You can save no one.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:19.480
Before us, you merely fall to your knees.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.490
The draw-skill samurai was no different.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:29.120
His arm was torn off, and he was 
crawling along the ground.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.280
Why, you...

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.500
What is this weak blade?

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:49.760
Tsukishima!

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:53.820
Yukimura...

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.770
It brings back so many memories 
to see you again, Princess Naa.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:03.530
I am deeply honored to see you.

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:07.530
So let us leave for our castle...

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.040
For Oosaka Castle, where the king waits.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.180
I have a task I must complete.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.540
I shall not accompany you.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.870
Very well.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:27.410
Then I shall take you there.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.510
My king will soon awaken.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.920
Now, come with me to Oosaka.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.520
Miss!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:48.490
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:56.100
Get to the Well now, miss!

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:01.750
To think you'd try to fight me 
with such weak power...

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.270
Miss, don't worry.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.270
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, shall protect 
you, even at the cost of my life!

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.270
You're wasting your time.

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:27.400
You'll die for nothing, like that samurai 
with the quick-draw swordsmanship.

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:31.490
Die for nothing?

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:36.160
Oooka-dono was a samurai among samurai.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:39.670
And when you mock him,

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.880
you're very wrong!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:48.950
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Storm!</i>

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:52.640
Plus...

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:55.930
<i>Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.050
<i>Tsukishima...</i>

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.430
<i>I shall go, then.</i>

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.530
<i>The Eternal Insects.</i>

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:33.590
<i>"Do not break the seal of the Eternal Well.</i>

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:37.150
<i>Only those who have overcome 
their painful pasts</i>

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:40.230
<i>will recover their power," is it?</i>

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.270
<i>Very well.</i>

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.320
I did it...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.690
Wh-What's this?

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.330
Tsukishima-dono, what happened?

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.330
I defeated Sanada Yukimura!

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.660
You defeated Yukimura?

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:05.540
Yes!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.550
Where is the princess?

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:07.590
Inside the Well!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:10.540
What's this?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.740
Princess Naa is regaining her power.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:27.860
You've seen through my illusions?

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.320
Interesting.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.360
You will now become an insect, body and soul!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.370
A fitting ending for an Insect Hunter

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.490
that has slain so many of us.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:46.700
<i>Great Forbidden Technique: 
Insect Resurrection!</i>

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:08.940
It appears that using your illusions to 
attack also weakens your defenses.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.150
I-Impossible...

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.930
"Uzumasa took his blade, {D: NB - from episode 7}

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.130
and he slew the greatest of 
the Eternal Land's gods."

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:23.040
<i>Enhanced Jingaitou: Insect Fusion!</i>

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:29.150
I'll take your insect power.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.550
To destroy Sanada's future!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.350
You bastard!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:45.810
It's time to go.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.090
To defeat the insects within Kishuu Castle.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.770
Sanada Yukimura!

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:00.700
Did you really think that would 
be enough to defeat me?

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:07.380
Delay Sanada until Princess Naa 
can regain all of her power!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:07.960
Yes, sir.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:12.090
It's funny, how little you know...

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.210
What?

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.590
Very well.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.400
Then try to delay me.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.360
Watch out...

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.350
Please dodge!

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.930
<i>Sanada Yukimura...</i>

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:47.270
<i>He's stronger than any foe I've ever faced.</i>

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:51.880
<i>But I am a samurai, and I will 
keep winning until I die.</i>

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:58.450
<i>And there are people behind 
me that I must protect.</i>

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.390
Prepare to die, Sanada Yukimura!

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:16.790
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:23.320
You'll never defeat me with a technique like that.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.520
But I'll give you this, little rat.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.420
You've entertained me as much 
as the quick draw practitioner.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:35.760
Tsukishima-dono!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:47.350
Die in agony from the poison.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.090
No, Princess!

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.920
Please give it here.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:13.860
No!

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.790
<i>What's this?</i>

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:22.260
<i>What is this scene?</i>

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>That girl... She looks just like the servant.</i>

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.800
What's going on?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.270
Father! Mother!

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:38.250
Everyone was being mean to 
Insect-san, so I saved him.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:43.780
Look.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.250
The poor thing...

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.110
Princess Naa...

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:51.100
What are you doing?

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.480
Take it from her!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.370
But...

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:56.670
There's nothing to fear.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.280
I will protect you.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.310
When she's being that way, she won't listen.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.930
It's fine...

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:14.940
Father!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.220
It's no good!

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.690
We've been annihilated!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.610
Our army is finished!

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:35.350
Now, run away.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:38.980
No!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.420
I can't stay with you!

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:45.370
This castle will soon fall to the enemy.

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.560
And then, I shall...

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:53.310
Farewell, cute Insect-san!

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.100
Princess Naa!

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:23.160
Where are you, Princess Naa?

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:26.470
Huh? Where am I?

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.720
Father? Mother?

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:31.720
Where am I?

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:37.070
The enemy is using poison...

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.050
Protect the princess!

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.230
You guys...

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.760
What happened?

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.740
Where are you, Princess Naa?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:51.730
If you can hear me, answer!

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.490
Father! Mother!

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.940
Run, my lord—

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.250
What are you?!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.200
Stay away!

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.340
Stay back!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.120
Father, don't be angry...

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.510
I'm taking the insect outside.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:21.040
Stay back!

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:24.180
What's wrong?

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.520
Stay away...

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.440
P-Power?

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:04.160
What do you mean by "power"?

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:07.320
You gave me your power?

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.720
Then, this is...

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.320
I did this?

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:33.540
No!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.170
Tsukishima?

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.180
Why are you here?

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.480
M-Miss...

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.740
Did you see my past?

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.740
My horrible past?

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:04.400
Disaster comes to everyone around me.

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:06.750
Everyone.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.360
I was foolish...

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:13.880
Everything began then.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:19.310
And all because I took pity on that insect.

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:27.350
That isn't true!

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:32.400
Your kindness in trying to protect 
that insect was right!

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:33.800
What?

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:39.500
If you say protecting the small 
and the weak is wrong,

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:43.630
then the whole world is wrong.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:48.450
I'm sure you've endured more 
pain than I can imagine.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:56.350
But you did the right thing, so a 
right future surely awaits you!

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.430
I believe that.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.730
Tsukishima...

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.880
You're warm...

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:19.200
Why are you so warm?

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:26.650
Can you feel my heart beating?

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:27.860
Y-Yes...

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:30.310
You gave this to me.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:34.820
For a century, my heart was frozen...

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:42.470
And you were the one who 
melted it, Tsukishima.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.970
Your smile...

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.140
Your warmth...

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:51.360
How many times they've 
made my heart flutter...

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.390
That warmth still fills my heart.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:59.900
This is human kindness, isn't it?

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.990
Thank you, Tsukishima.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.850
And I thank you!

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:11.610
I gain power from your smile, as well.

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:16.080
Oharu-dono and Hibachi-dono, 
Koikawa-dono, and Tenma-dono...

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.910
And Mugai-dono...

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:20.210
He doesn't really smile much.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:25.780
But your smile gives me so much power!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.670
Now, let's do our best at our tasks.

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:43.870
I, Tsukikishima Jinbei,
 will follow you to the end!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.170
Your task ends here.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.720
I shall never forget the warmth

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.260
you have given me.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.950
M-Miss!

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:16.440
M-Miss!

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:29.200
This is a sign that Princess Naa has 
completely regained her power!

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:32.410
What's so funny?

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:36.630
The princess regaining her power 
within the Eternal Well

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.800
is exactly what we wanted.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:39.860
What?

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.670
When the princess completely regains her power,

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:48.310
she and my king will wipe 
humanity from this land.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:50.640
What nonsense is this?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:56.140
Do you think the Eternal Well grants 
insects power without a price?

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:59.240
They say it takes memories.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:03.570
And the greater the power it bestows, 
the more it will take...

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.810
Should the princess regain her entire power,

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:12.000
she will lose all of her memories!

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:17.530
H-Her memories will disappear?

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:21.000
Our last hope...

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:22.880
No...

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:27.720
You lose, humans.

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.610
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:03.620
Hibachi-dono, I'll use your loincloth 
to pull the servant from the Well!

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:04.510
Remove it!

00:23:04.510 --> 00:23:05.720
Okay, sure...

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:07.270
Of course I won't do that!

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:10.780
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:14.000
The Promise Is Hope Within Despair.

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Promise Is Hope Within Despair</b>
